From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes Local Compatibility CI <hermes-local-ci@localhost>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 00:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 37/37] refactor(desktop): consolidate stack controls on Home

Move the low-frequency stack operations and transactional Hermes Agent
update workflow onto the Home surface, which already owns stack health and
the Start/Stop/Restart controls. Remove Services from the sidebar and keep
/services as a compatibility redirect to Home.

The existing Task Centre-backed ActionButton behavior remains authoritative,
so in-flight operations stay deduplicated and their latest result remains
visible from Home.

---
